Cell["Classification tables", "Section", ExpressionUUID->"fcbd5dfc-b46c-4d2a-9792-aed23f5eaf90"],

Cell["\<\
The first three representatives classify triangles by equal side lengths; \
equilateral triangles are included among isosceles triangles. The last three \
classify triangles by their interior angles. Marks indicate equal sides or \
the relevant angle. Each diagram is one representative, not a restriction on \
other members of its class.\
\>", "Text", ExpressionUUID->"7f247bb2-54ad-4896-9e9e-244937d0f8f1"],

